Added startup image pull to reconciler. Previously has_image() returned true for stale local images, so updated registry images were never pulled. Now: first reconciliation cycle (FIRST_RUN_DONE atomic flag) always pulls to check for updates. Subsequent cycles only pull if missing. If pull fails but local exists, falls back with warning. This fixes the /v1/session/send 404 caused by stale claude-sdk harness images missing the session endpoint.
